"""
HVPNL APPROVAL SEARCH - Single-file desktop application
========================================================

INSTALL (Windows):
    py -m pip install PySide6 PyMuPDF watchdog

For OCR + scanned PDFs:
    py -m pip install pytesseract pillow

Poppler/pdf2image is NOT required in this version.

For semantic / AI search:
    py -m pip install sentence-transformers numpy

RUN:
    py index.py

RUN WITHOUT A COMMAND PROMPT WINDOW (Windows):
    pythonw index.py

Indexing and maintenance tools are reserved for the separate Developer version.

Optional OCR support for image-only/scanned PDFs:
    py -m pip install pytesseract pdf2image pillow
and install Tesseract OCR separately.

Features:
- Single Python source file
- Automatic recovery from a malformed SQLite index
    - Verified index is durably committed to encrypted index.db before success
- Prevents concurrent indexing/database-lock errors
- Select and recursively index a folder of PDFs
- Automatically watches folder for new/modified PDFs
- SQLite database + FTS5 full-text index
- Metadata extraction: Approval No., Approval Code, Date, File/Memo No., Subject
- Multi-word AND search: "Roz Pal" means Roz AND Pal
- Exact phrase search with quotes: "Roz ka Meo"
- Higher approval number shown first
- Configurable context words before/after match
- Configurable highlight colour
- Multiple snippets for multiple matches
- PDF preview with searched terms highlighted
- User version has no Index Progress tab
- Stop Indexing button for safe cancellation
- Indexing errors shown inside the app instead of a separate Command Prompt
"""

